Subject: [PATCH] ui: align timeline panorama spans and compact 24-hour actions

Use library cover-shape, column and spanning rules for timeline panorama. Calculate cover plus footer and date heights without composing offscreen records. Keep native compact/list modes. Share 36dp action row, 28dp controls, ASCII HH:mm and filled library hearts. Preserve download file sizes in Anikku subtitles. Cover 10000 records, two-lane landscape cards and save/restore resizing with Compose regressions.
